---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import ArticleCard from "../../components/content/ArticleCard.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Magic Corner — DreaMax | Tech Insights & AI Industry Analysis" description="Tech热点、行业观察、深度思考。AI 商业化分析、NVIDIA WAM 机器人新范式、Google DiffusionGemma 扩散模型 —— 记录 AI 时代的每一个拐点。">
  <section class="min-h-screen px-6 pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width:960px;">
      <h1 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
        <span class="accent-bar" style="background:#c586c0;"></span>Magic Corner
      </h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-sm" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Tech热点、行业观察、深度思考 — 记录 AI 时代的每一个拐点。</p>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5" style="margin-top:48px;">

        <!-- Article 1 -->
        <a href="/magic-corner/ai-charging" class="block no-underline card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm hover:-translate-y-[2px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs" style="color:#e31b6d; letter-spacing:2px;">INDUSTRY</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/20">&middot;</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/25">2026-06</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-white" style="margin-top:12px;">国产大模型集体涨价：从免费到付费，AI 公司的生存之战</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/50" style="margin-top:8px; font-weight:300; line-height:1.6;">豆包、智谱、Kimi……2026年的中国AI市场正在经历一场剧烈的商业化转型。谁在涨价，谁在降价，靠什么赚钱？</p>
            <div class="flex gap-2" style="margin-top:12px;">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">AI 商业化</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">大模型</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">商业模式</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Article 2 -->
        <a href="/magic-corner/nvidia-wam" class="block no-underline card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm hover:-translate-y-[2px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs" style="color:#66d9ed; letter-spacing:2px;">ROBOTICS</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/20">&middot;</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/25">2026-06</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-white" style="margin-top:12px;">VLA已死，WAM当立：英伟达宣布机器人技术路线的历史性转向</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/50" style="margin-top:8px; font-weight:300; line-height:1.6;">Jim Fan 在红杉 AI Ascent 大会上连开两场"葬礼"——送别 VLA 和遥操作。英伟达的新范式 WAM 能否带来机器人的 GPT 时刻？</p>
            <div class="flex gap-2" style="margin-top:12px;">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">NVIDIA</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">具身智能</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">世界模型</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Article 3 -->
        <a href="/magic-corner/diffusion-gemma" class="block no-underline card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm hover:-translate-y-[2px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs" style="color:#ff6b2b; letter-spacing:2px;">BREAKTHROUGH</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/20">&middot;</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/25">2026-06</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-white" style="margin-top:12px;">Google DiffusionGemma：扩散模型正在颠覆文本生成的方式</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/50" style="margin-top:8px; font-weight:300; line-height:1.6;">4倍加速、并行生成、Apache 2.0开源——DiffusionGemma 可能是2026年最重要的 AI 模型发布之一。它意味着什么？</p>
            <div class="flex gap-2" style="margin-top:12px;">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">Google</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">扩散模型</span>
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-white/8 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-white/35">开源</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
